<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_gradient__paint_8hpp">glm/gtx/gradient_paint.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Functions that return the color of procedural gradient for specific coordinates.</para>
</section>
